1
00:00:00,392 --> 00:00:03,392
(Penny:)Really?
Well, then will you explain it to me?

2
00:00:03,562 --> 00:00:05,652
(Ramona:)You're in love with Dr. Cooper.

3
00:00:06,732 --> 00:00:09,402
(Penny:)Uh, yeah, no, that's not it.

4
00:00:09,902 --> 00:00:11,612
(Ramona:)Don't try to deny it.

5
00:00:11,779 --> 00:00:15,199
(Ramona:)He's a remarkable man,
but you have to let him go.

6
00:00:15,366 --> 00:00:18,326
(Penny:)Oh, gee. Okay.

7
00:00:18,827 --> 00:00:23,207
(Ramona:)I know it's hard, but he's a gift
to the whole world, and we can't be selfish.

8
00:00:23,374 --> 00:00:25,874
(Penny:)Yeah, he's a gift, all right.

9
00:00:27,002 --> 00:00:28,832
(Ramona:)Sisters?

10
00:00:32,007 --> 00:00:34,217
Sure, sisters. Heh, heh.

11
00:00:34,385 --> 00:00:36,555
(Ramona:)Okay.

12
00:00:39,014 --> 00:00:41,514
(Penny:)Holy crap on a cracker.

13
00:00:43,394 --> 00:00:45,394
[TAPPING ON WALL]

14
00:00:49,858 --> 00:00:50,988
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

15
00:00:57,074 --> 00:01:02,024
(Leonard:)- What are you doing?
SHELDON: It's Morse code.

